### Cambiar la unidad de una ejecución por unitId — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/changeUnit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "unitId": 2
}

### Cambiar la unidad por unitPrivateCode — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/changeUnit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "unitPrivateCode": "U-002"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/changeUnit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "unitId": 2
}

### Sin workPlanExecutionId (requerido) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/changeUnit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "unitId": 2
}

### Sin unitId ni unitPrivateCode (uno es requerido) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/changeUnit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1
}

### Unidad inexistente → 400/500 según manejo del SP
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/changeUnit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "unitPrivateCode": "NO-EXISTE"
}
